.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt MKFIFO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mkfifo
.Nd create named pipes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl m Ar mode
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
creates named pipes (FIFOs) named by each
.Ar file .
.Pp
the options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl m Ar mode
set the file permission bits to
.Ar mode .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
